Subject: libubox: update to 2026-11-03

libubox from OpenWrt main as of 3 November 2026 instead of the one of
21 July: blobmsg_json no longer reads past the end of an attribute that
is not extended, uloop_cancelled and uloop_status are safe to set from a
signal handler, and the kqueue fixes that Linux does not use.

The library carries its date in its name, so this one is
libubox20261103; everything in the image and in the feed is built
against it.

OpenWrt commit 3119b57902, taken as it is.

